# Keeping the build context small matters: without this it ships hundreds of MB
# of bin/obj and node_modules to the daemon on every build.

**/bin/
**/obj/
**/out/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/.vite/
**/.turbo/

.git/
.github/
.vscode/
.idea/
**/.DS_Store

**/*.user
**/*.suo
**/TestResults/
**/coverage/

docs/
*.md
!README.md

**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
